  "topography": {
    "project_purpose": "Fulcrom is a decentralized perpetual/leverage trading protocol with FUL and FLP staking and liquidity products. Its current chain presence includes Cronos, zkSync Era, and Cronos zkEVM; the indexed contract surface should be understood as covering only the listed contracts unless Cronos zkEVM contracts are added separately. Unsupported claims that Fulcrom provides general spot trading through a Fulcrom-owned AMM should be removed unless independently verified contracts and documentation are added.",
    "relationship_narrative": "The Fulcrom AMM and Perps families rely on the shared Fulcrom Core infrastructure for vaults, tokens, and oracles. The Cronos and zkSync Era families provide chain-specific adapters that integrate the core protocol with each blockchain.",
